# Generated experiment output. These are artifacts, not experiment source.
#
# code_state() records source_dirty for the whole of Simulations/ with
# --untracked-files=all, and every official run refuses to start on a dirty
# tree. A stray generated PNG is therefore enough to mark a finished campaign
# as uncertifiable: 39 leftover figures under SVGP_Benchmark_Modern/ made all
# 280 runs of the collapsed campaign invalid, after ten hours of GPU time.
# Keeping output out of git is what makes the source check mean what it says.
runs_*/
logs_*/
figures_*/
tables_*/
experiment_results/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
